          "n": "214",
          "text": "Once upon a time the king of heaven, Hwanin sent his son Hwanung"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "to earth."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "215",
          "text": "There he married Ungnyo who changed from a bear into a woman."
        },
        {
          "n": "216",
          "text": "She gave birth to a son named Tangun."
        },
        {
          "n": "217",
          "text": "He became the founder of Korea."
        }
